We adopt percentile-based thresholding: at iteration <math id="A2.T5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, the top <math id="A2.T5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\tau_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\tau_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> fraction of pseudo-labels (ranked by similarity) is selected.</span></figcaption>
